nd grammatical structures, and with intelligible pronunciation.", "type": "secondary_8"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": " Formal Phone Conversations", "type": "heading"}, {"content": " When you speak to an employer on the phone, you use polite, formal language.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "<span class=\"strong\">Mr. Warren</span>: Hello, my name is Fred Warren. I'd like to speak to Peter Smith, please. </br><span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: This is Peter Smith.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":4,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\"> Formal Language</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\"> Informal Language</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Hello, my name is ...\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Hi, this is ...</br> Hi, it's ...\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"I'd like to speak to ...</br> Can I please speak to ...\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Is ... there?</br> I want to talk to ...\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"This is ... </br> I'm ...\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Hello.</br> Hi.\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}", "type": "table"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "Making and Responding to Requests", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "You use modals like <span class=\"strong\">would </span>and <span class=\"strong\">could</span> in formal conversations to make and respond to requests. The modal <span class=\"strong\">can</span> is less formal.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "<span class=\"strong\">Mr. Warren</span>: Could you come for an interview?</br>  <span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: I would be happy to.</br> ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "A response to 