entry level position to learn about the company.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn3le06ob01aud05", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "intern ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a person who is training at a job", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: This company has two interns learning how to do things.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn3le06ob01aud06", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "background ", "type": "name"}, {"content": " past experience at work or school", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: He has a background in business studies.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn3le06ob01aud07", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "research ", "type": "name"}, {"content": " information on a topic", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: She has to do some research on marketing ads.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn3le06ob01aud08", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "interview ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a formal meeting to get a job", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: She is at an interview for a new position.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn3le06ob01aud09", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "variety ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "different types of things", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Interns do a variety of jobs here.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn3le06ob01aud10", "type": "audio"}]}, {"content": "engenn3le06ob01re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"content": "Look for information about a job online.", "type": "text"},